{{Item|Crimson Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in the {{Zone|crimson isle}}.

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Crimson Essence}} can be be obtained in the {{Zone|crimson isle}} in multiple ways:
* Opening chests from [[Kuudra]] runs.
* [[Salvaging#Crimson|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Crimson Essence}}.
* Killing certain mobs:
